    each chamber is a rectangular block of bg pixels between adjacent wall rows and within/outside wall cols
    each chamber touches >=1 marker pixel orthogonally
    each chamber has a unique strict majority marker color among its adjacent marker pixels (no ties)
  output: fill each bg chamber with its majority marker color; wall and marker pixels unchanged

generation_strategy:
